# Task 6 – Reporting View

## Objective

Create a reporting view containing

- Publication Number
- Inventor Name
- Publication Date
- Direct Citation Count
- Total Citation Count
- Maximum Citation Depth

---

## Direct Citation Count

Counts

```
Depth = 1
```

---

## Total Citation Count

Counts every citation in the recursive hierarchy.

Example

```
Patent A

→ Patent B

→ Patent C

→ Patent D
```

Total

```
3
```

---

## Maximum Citation Depth

Longest path in the hierarchy.

Example

```
A
└──B
     └──C
          └──D
```

Maximum Depth

```
3
```

---

## Why create a View?

Advantages

- reusable
- hides complex SQL
- easy reporting
- simplifies BI tools

---

# Task 7 – Materialized View

## Objective

Store the reporting result physically.

```
CREATE MATERIALIZED VIEW
```

instead of

```
CREATE VIEW
```

---

## Difference

View

```
Runs SQL every time
```

Materialized View

```
Stores computed data
```

---

## Benefit

Significantly faster for reporting.

Especially useful on

```
1 Million Records
```

---

