# Task 9 – Refresh Testing

## Objective

Insert additional citation records.

Observe

### View

Immediately reflects

```
new data
```

because SQL executes every time.

---

### Materialized View

Does NOT update automatically.

Requires

```
REFRESH MATERIALIZED VIEW
```

or

```
REFRESH MATERIALIZED VIEW CONCURRENTLY
```

---

## Validation

Before Refresh

```
Old Counts
```

After Refresh

```
Updated Counts
```

